Transform your browsing experience with AI-powered bookmark organization! This intelligent Chrome extension automatically categorizes your bookmarks and helps you discover related content while browsing.
✨ Key Features:
AI-Powered Categorization - Automatically organizes bookmarks into smart categories
Related Content Discovery - Floating icon shows relevant bookmarks for any webpage
Smart Search & Organization - Find bookmarks instantly with intelligent search
AI Notes Generation - Generate comprehensive study notes from any webpage using Azure OpenAI
Cross-Platform Sync - Access your organized bookmarks across all devices
